---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Summary from '../components/Summary.astro';
import Divider from '../components/Divider.astro';
---
<Base title={"Individual Counseling in Utah | Tangible Therapy"} description={"Judgment-free individual counseling in Utah for anxiety, depression, trauma, and more. Compassionate therapists in Provo & Orem with most insurances accepted. Start today!"}>
<section class="sec t-black h-medium has-bg has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-bg"><img src="/images/tangible-31-e8444f.jpg" alt="A therapist and client in a calm conversation in a bright office with tall plants at Tangible Therapy in Utah" style="object-position:50% 50%" loading="eager"><div class="sec-ov" style="opacity:0.4"></div></div><div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:6;--mrows:9">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/5/21;--m:1/2/7/10"><div class="rte"><h1 class="ta-center">Individual Counseling</h1><p class="ta-center">Find clarity, feel supported, and start creating real change in your life.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:5/11/7/17;--m:7/3/9/9;--dz:4;--mz:4"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Book Your First Session</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#fff" /></section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:19">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/13/26;--m:12/2/19/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-counseling-944d69.jpg" alt="Female therapist engaging in Individual counseling with a woman at Tangible Therapy in Utah. Inside a cozy office with warm tones and plants" width="2500" height="1578" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/5/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Support when life feels heavy</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/11/12;--m:4/2/12/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Life doesn’t always make sense. Some days feel more challenging than others. When stress builds, relationships strain, or emotions run high, you don’t have to face it alone. Counseling offers the support and structure to help you find your footing again.</p><p>At Tangible Therapy, we create a safe space where you can show up exactly as you are. There are no filters or judgment, only real conversations that lead to real change.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:15;--mrows:23">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/2/14/13;--m:15/2/23/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-therapy-male-23b44e.jpg" alt="Female therapist meets with a man doing counseling at Tangible Therapy in Sandy Utah, sitting on a couch in a warm tone room with plants." width="2439" height="1932" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/15/5/25;--m:2/2/5/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>A space made for you</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/15/13/25;--m:5/2/15/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Our therapists take time to understand what matters most to you. We start by listening, really listening, to your thoughts, worries, and experiences.&nbsp;</p><p>Whether you’re dealing with anxiety, depression, loss, relationship issues, trauma, or burnout, our approach is shaped around your needs and goals.</p><p>Sessions are confidential, compassionate, and centered on you. This is your time to unpack whatever’s weighing on your mind.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:14;--mrows:23">
  <div class="b b-image jc" style="--d:2/15/14/26;--m:17/2/24/10;--dz:4;--mz:4"><figure class="img fill" style="--r:50px"><img src="/images/tangible-therapy-ladies-be199d.jpg" alt="A female therapist does counseling with a woman at Tangible Therapy in Orem Utah. The woman sits on a couch surrounded by plants." width="2203" height="1702" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></figure></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:3/2/5/12;--m:1/2/4/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h3>Real support and growth</h3></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:5/2/13/12;--m:4/2/16/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="rte"><p>Counseling isn’t about having all the answers. It’s about asking the right questions, exploring what’s underneath the surface, and building the tools to respond in healthier ways.</p><p>Our counselors use proven methods to help you gain clarity, strengthen emotional resilience, and develop new strategies for coping with life’s stressors. Over time, you’ll start to notice shifts in how you think, feel, and relate to others.</p><p>We work with individuals, couples, and families. Whether you want to heal, grow, or reconnect, we’re here to help you take meaningful steps forward.</p></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-small">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:9;--mrows:11">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/6/4/22;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Let’s get started</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:4/5/7/23;--m:3/2/9/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><p class="lg ta-center">When you’re ready, we’re here to help you take that first step. Schedule your first session today and start building something stronger, steadier, and more you.</p></div></div>
  <div class="b b-button jc" style="--d:7/11/9/17;--m:9/2/11/10;--dz:3;--mz:3"><div class="btn-wrap ta-center"><a class="btn btn-primary btn-medium btn-full" href="/contact">Book Your First Appointment</a></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-bright-inverse h-small has-div" style="--divh:6vw">
<div class="sec-in" style="padding-top:6.6vmax;padding-bottom:6.6vmax">
<div class="wrap"><div class="list-title rte"><p>What you’ll get</p></div><ul class="ulist ulist-carousel" style="--per:3;--ar:3/2;--tfs:calc((2.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--bfs:calc((1.2 - 1) * var(--fs-unit) + 1rem);--cw:75%;--gap:20px"><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="#" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>50 minutes of professional insight and unconditional support</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A better relationship with yourself, your thoughts, and your emotions</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>Clinically precise guidance tailored to you and the problems you’re facing</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New skills guided by expertise and experience that will create meaningful change</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>A comfortable and inviting atmosphere that promotes mindful reflection and calm</p></div></div></li><li class="li"><a class="li-link" href="/" aria-label="✺"></a><div class="li-body"><h3 class="li-title">✺</h3><div class="rte li-desc"><p>New insights into how your mind works and why it engages in unhelpful patterns</p></div></div></li></ul><div class="carousel-nav"><button class="prev" aria-label="Previous"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 12H5m6-6-6 6 6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button><button class="next" aria-label="Next"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="28" height="28" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></button></div></div>
</div>
<Divider type="wavy" height={6} width={100} fill="#565d57" /></section>

<section class="sec t-light h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:16;--mrows:7">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:1/7/3/22;--m:1/2/3/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center">Therapists with Openings</h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-summary-v2" style="--d:3/5/17/24;--m:3/2/8/10"><Summary kind="team" design="carousel" category="telehealth/current-openings-1" limit={9} perRow={3} rounded /></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="sec t-black h-medium">
<div class="sec-in">
<div class="fe" style="--rows:13;--mrows:20">
  <div class="b b-html" style="--d:2/2/4/26;--m:1/2/4/10"><div class="rte"><h2 class="ta-center"> Frequently asked questions </h2></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/2/14/13;--m:5/2/13/10"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What types of issues do you help with in individual counseling?</summary><div class="rte"><p>We support clients through a wide range of challenges, including anxiety, depression, burnout, trauma, self-esteem issues, grief, OCD life transitions, LGBTQ+ issues and more. If it’s affecting your daily life or emotional well-being, it’s worth bringing to the session.</p></div></details><details><summary>Is counseling right for me if I’m not in crisis?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Absolutely. You don’t have to be falling apart to benefit from therapy. Counseling can help you gain insight, build better habits, and feel more grounded — even if things seem “mostly fine.”</p></div></details><details><summary>How do I get started with a therapist?</summary><div class="rte"><p>You can schedule a free 15-minute consultation to see if one of our therapists is a good match. From there, we’ll set up your first full session and begin creating a plan that fits your goals.</p><p><br/></p></div></details></div></div>
  <div class="b b-accordion" style="--d:6/15/10/26;--m:13/2/21/10;--dz:2;--mz:2"><div class="accordion"><details><summary>What will my first session be like?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Your first session is about getting to know you. We’ll talk about what’s bringing you in, your personal history, and what you’d like to work on. You won’t need to prepare anything or have all the answers — simply show up as you are.</p></div></details><details><summary>How often do I need to come in?</summary><div class="rte"><p>Most clients start with weekly sessions to build momentum, then adjust as needed. You and your therapist will decide on a pace that feels sustainable and supportive for you.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
